DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nCommunity Screenings A young boy
 \, Elliott\, discovers and befriends a friendly alien stranded on Earth. T
 ogether\, they embark on a heartwarming and magical adventure\, teaching u
 s the power of friendship\, love\, and the boundless wonders of the univer
 se. 4K restoration\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/community-s
 creenings/et-the-extra-terrestrial\n\nEstimated start: 11:15
